oomIn&quot;,&quot;_transform_scale_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;slideshow&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;background_slideshow_gallery&quot;:[],&quot;background_slideshow_loop&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;background_slideshow_slide_duration&quot;:5000,&quot;background_slideshow_slide_transition&quot;:&quot;fade&quot;,&quot;background_slideshow_transition_duration&quot;:500,&quot;_transform_scale_effect_hover_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_scale_effect_hover_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\" id=\"OVM\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\"> <div data-id=\"8d4a7da\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInDown&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"> <p><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1400\" height=\"2000\" src=\"https://www.lucioarese.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/SBM.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.lucioarese.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/SBM.jpg 1400w, https://www.lucioarese.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/SBM-210x300.jpg 210w, https://www.lucioarese.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/SBM-717x1024.jpg 717w, https://www.lucioarese.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/SBM-768x1097.jpg 768w, https://www.lucioarese.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/SBM-1075x1536.jpg 1075w, https://www.lucioarese.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/SBM-700x1000.jpg 700w, https://www.lucioarese.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/SBM-1100x1571.jpg 1100w, https://www.lucioarese.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/SBM-600x857.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1400px) 100vw, 1400px\"> </p> </div> <div data-id=\"bae00ea\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"> <ul><li><strong>© Lucio Arese 2025. All Rights Reserved.</strong></li></ul> </div> </div> <div data-id=\"37f5437\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_transform_scale_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1.05,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;_transform_scale_effect_hover_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_scale_effect_hover_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\" id=\"OV\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\"> <div data-id=\"e401954\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"> <ul><li><strong>Seeing Birdsong </strong>is an evolving framework that trasforms avian vocalizations into geometric form<strong><em>.</em></strong></li><li>&nbsp;</li><li>It was first presented publicly at the <strong>4th Ultrasonic Vocalization Conference</strong> hosted by</li><li><strong>Nencki Institute of Experimental Biology</strong>, part of the <strong>Polish Academy of Sciences</strong>.</li><li>&nbsp;</li><li>Its goal is to bridge <strong>art</strong> and <strong>acoustic science</strong>, offering new ways to perceive and study complex animal vocal patterns.</li></ul> </div> <div data-id=\"6171416\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"> <ul><li><strong>Seeing Birdsong </strong>is an evolving framework that trasforms avian vocalizations into geometric form<strong><em>.</em></strong></li><li>&nbsp;</li><li>It was first presented publicly at the <strong>4th Ultrasonic Vocalization Conference</strong> hosted by</li><li><strong>Nencki Institute of Experimental Biology</strong>, part of the <strong>Polish Academy of Sciences</strong>.</li><li>&nbsp;</li><li>Its goal is to bridge <strong>art</strong> and <strong>acoustic science</strong>, offering new ways to perceive and study complex animal vocal patterns.</li></ul> </div> </div> <div data-id=\"f50bd23\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_transform_scale_effect&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_scale_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1.05,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;_transform_scale_effect_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_scale_effect_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_scale_effect_hover_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_scale_effect_hover_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\" id=\"overview\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\"> <div data-id=\"07104e3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"> <ul> <li><strong><em>Birdsong is one of nature’s most expressive voices.</em></strong></li> <li></li> <li>This project began as an attempt to give it visible form,</li> <li>transforming sound into spatial structures through</li> <li>early audio-driven oscillator experiments.</li>\n</ul> </div> <div data-id=\"1c3fa89\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"> <ul><li>Extensive research and development evolved it</li><li>into a <strong>rigorous system of acoustic analysis</strong>. The framework now</li><li><strong>bridges art and science</strong>, turning avian voices into <strong>dynamic</strong>,</li><li><strong>data-rich structures</strong>. It offers a new way to perceive,</li><li>study and preserve the complexity of bird vocalizations.</li></ul> </div> </div> <div data-id=\"707d000\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_transform_scale_effect&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;slideshow&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;background_slideshow_gallery&quot;:[],&quot;background_slideshow_loop&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;background_slideshow_slide_duration&quot;:5000,&quot;background_slideshow_slide_transition&quot;:&quot;fade&quot;,&quot;background_slideshow_transition_duration&quot;:500,&quot;_transform_scale_effect_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_scale_effect_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_scaleX_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_scaleX_effect_hover_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_scaleX_effect_hover_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_scaleY_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_scaleY_effect_hover_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_scaleY_effect_hover_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\"> <div data-id=\"dbcbc9c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"> <ul><li><strong><em>Birdsong is one of nature’s most expressive voices.</em></strong></li><li>&nbsp;</li><li>This project began as an attempt to give it visible form,</li><li>transforming sound into spatial structures through</li><li>early audio-driven oscillator experiments.</li></ul> </div> <div data-id=\"5f859a0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"> <ul><li>Extensive research and development evolved it</li><li>into a <strong>rigorous system of acoustic analysis</strong>. The framework now <strong>bridges art and science</strong>, turning avian voices into <strong>dynamic</strong>, <strong>data-rich structures</strong>.</li><li>It offers a new way to perceive, study and preserve the complexity of bird vocalizations.</li></ul> </div> </div> <div data-id=\"c9cf595\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_transform_scale_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1.05,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;_transform_scale_effect_hover_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_scale_effect_hover_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\" id=\"SYS\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\"> <div data-id=\"f2b2ac5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"> <ul><li>The system elaborates audio into <strong>high-dimensional vectors</strong>,</li><li>embedding them within dynamic <strong>three-dimensional manifolds</strong>.</li><li>&nbsp;</li></ul> </div> <div data-id=\"b19ea1b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"> <ul><li>Its internal architecture is built on a <strong>multi-layered network of </strong></li><li><strong>spectral descriptors</strong>, fully convertible into <strong>visual form</strong></li><li>into a wealth of <strong>2d</strong> and <strong>3d graphs</strong>.</li><li>&nbsp;</li></ul> </div> <div data-id=\"894fcdf\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"> <ul><li>The result is a <strong>multi-faceted visual ecosystem</strong>, enabling <strong>novel ways</strong> to</li><li>analytically explore the <strong>hidden structures of sound</strong>.</li></ul> </div> </div> <div data-id=\"8941a7f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;_transform_scaleX_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_scaleX_effect_hover_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_scaleX_effect_hover_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_scaleY_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_scaleY_effect_hover_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_scaleY_effect_hover_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\" id=\"SYSM\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\"> <div data-id=\"a513db9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"> <ul><li>The system elaborates audio into <strong>high-dimensional vectors</strong>, embedding them within dynamic</li><li><strong>three-dimensional manifolds</strong>.</li><li>&nbsp;</li></ul> </div> <div data-id=\"3570e0f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"> <ul><li>Its internal architecture is built on a <strong>multi-layered network of </strong><strong>spectral descriptors</strong>, fully convertible into<strong> visual form </strong>into a wealth of <strong>2d</strong> and <strong>3d graphs</strong>.</li><li>&nbsp;</li></ul> </div> <div data-id=\"e6c5414\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"> <ul><li>The result is a <strong>multi-faceted visual ecosystem</strong>, enabling <strong>novel ways</strong> to analytically explore the</li><li><strong>hidden structures of sound</strong>.</li></ul> </div> </div> <div data-id=\"2c17711\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_transform_scale_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1.05,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;_transform_scale_effect_hover_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_scale_effect_hover_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\" id=\"APP\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\"> <div data-id=\"f98da3b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"> <ul><li><strong>FOR ART</strong></li></ul> </div> <div data-id=\"212ddba\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"> <ul><li>Live audio–visual performances.</li><li>Data-driven generative installations.</li><li>Visual storytelling of sound.</li><li>&nbsp;</li></ul> </div> <div data-id=\"c4c3160\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"> <ul><li><strong>FOR SCIENCE</strong></li></ul> </div> <div data-id=\"215162f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"> <ul><li>Comparative vocal analysis.</li><li>Pattern discovery in high-dimensional data.</li><li>Visual support for hypothesis generation.</li><li>&nbsp;</li></ul> </div> <div data-id=\"dbdf455\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"> <ul><li><strong>FOR EDUCATION</strong></li></ul> </div> <div data-id=\"d3d1e58\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"> <ul><li>Teaching acoustic concepts through visuals.</li><li>Intuitive exploration of pitch and timbre.</li><li>Demonstrations for workshops and museums.</li></ul> </div> </div> <div data-id=\"16dfbda\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;_transform_scaleX_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_scaleX_effect_hover_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_scaleX_effect_hover_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_scaleY_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_scaleY_effect_hover_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_scaleY_effect_hover_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\" id=\"APPM\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\"> <div data-id=\"92dce6f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"> <ul><li><strong>FOR ART</strong></li></ul> </div> <div data-id=\"d5016e6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"> <ul><li>Live audio–visual performances.</li><li>Data-driven generative installations.</li><li>Visual storytelling of sound.</li><li>&nbsp;</li></ul> </div> <div data-id=\"c59b028\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"> <ul><li><strong>FOR SCIENCE</strong></li></ul> </div> <div data-id=\"1dae079\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"> <ul><li>Comparative vocal analysis.</li><li>Pattern discovery in high-dimensional data.</li><li>Visual support for hypothesis generation.</li><li>&nbsp;</li></ul> </div> <div data-id=\"1080f61\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"> <ul><li><strong>FOR EDUCATION</strong></li></ul> </div> <div data-id=\"fbff43b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"> <ul><li>Teaching acoustic concepts through visuals.</li><li>Intuitive exploration of pitch and timbre.</li><li>Demonstrations for workshops and museums.</li></ul> </div> </div> <div data-id=\"a81be91\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_transform_scale_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1.05,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;bo